<title>JAPAN: Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</title>
<headline>Mikuni assigns preliminary bond credit ratings.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mikuni and Co Ltd said on Friday it had assigned the following preliminary ratings to planned bond issues:</p>
<p>-A-</p>
<p>Tokyo Electric Power Co Inc,</p>
<p>150 billion yen mortgaged due 2006,</p>
<p>50 billion yen mortgaged due 2016.</p>
<p>-B-</p>
<p>Mitsuba Electric Mfg Co Ltd, five billion euroyen unsecured convertible due 2004.</p>
<p>Orix Corp, 20 billion yen unsecured due 2001.  </p>
<p>Sumitomo Realty &amp; Development Co Ltd,</p>
<p>10 billion euroyen unsecured due 2001, private placement,</p>
<p>10 billion euroyen unsecured due 2002, private placement.</p>
<p>Toyobo Co Ltd,</p>
<p>five billion yen unsecured due 2000,</p>
<p>five billion yen unsecured due 2001,</p>
<p>five billion yen unsecured due 2002,</p>
<p>five billion yen unsecured due 2003.</p>
</text>
